WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:11.860
Coach, is it a loss this time?

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:16.270
Goal!

00:00:16.270 --> 00:00:18.740
Eito Academy gets the first point!

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:23.210
Senpai's hissatsu technique was broken past?

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:28.590
I can't believe Sangoku-senpai's hissatsu technique was taken down that easily...

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:31.780
Will we really be able to win?

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:41.320
It's okay, Senpai!

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:43.350
It's still one point!

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:44.880
We'll catch up to them!

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:46.720
The two of us will do our best, too!

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:47.560
Right, Shinsuke?

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:49.340
Tenma...

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:50.770
Yeah!

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:53.630
He doesn't even know anything.

00:00:53.630 --> 00:00:55.710
Someone just tell him already.

00:02:36.290 --> 00:02:38.950
Both teams are back in position!

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:41.300
The match resumes with Raimon possessing the ball!

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:43.180
The point difference is just one point!

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:45.560
Can Raimon catch up?!

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:48.880
All right, let's go!

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:52.450
Tenma! Shinsuke! You can do it!

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:55.230
Show 'em your hidden strength, Tenma!

00:02:56.120 --> 00:02:57.740
Only two more points left.

00:02:57.740 --> 00:02:59.490
Please, Shindou-san.

00:03:01.100 --> 00:03:03.070
The game resumes with Raimon's kickoff!

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:06.080
And the ball gets stolen immediately!

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:09.500
Here he comes!

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:12.800
Their newest addition, Matsukaze Tenma, moves up!

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:17.330
Oh, but he's easily dodged!

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:19.460
Is he really part of the first team?

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:22.430
Yukiji!

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:24.180
There's the centering!

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:26.250
You can't have it!

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:29.060
But Nishizono cuts in!

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:32.190
Great job, Shinsuke!

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:39.460
What are you trying to pull?

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:43.700
Didn't I say that <i>we</i>  would be dominating until we've made the second point?

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:47.930
Shinsuke!

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:49.690
Captain!

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:52.890
The ball goes to Shindou!

00:03:52.890 --> 00:03:54.460
Will Raimon counterattack?

00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:56.210
All right!

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:58.170
Here it comes! Hayato!

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:01.330
Shindou-san!

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:09.520
Thief Eye!

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:15.270
The ball gets stolen from Shindou!

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:21.140
Kakizaki.{書崎} Defense hissatsu technique x2.

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:23.470
Yomiya!

00:04:29.010 --> 00:04:32.500
Their lead appears to be motivating them, because Eito Academy's offense stays strong!

00:04:33.090 --> 00:04:35.500
It's no use, we're being completely pushed back!

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:38.280
Amagi! Kirino!

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:38.280
{o}Yukiji!

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:40.250
Raimon's caught in their bluff!

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:42.530
Perfect Course!

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:02.330
Burning Catch!

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:09.410
Sangoku-senpai should be fine. He'll stop it this time!

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:19.510
Goal!

00:05:19.510 --> 00:05:21.510
Eito Academy wins another point!

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:24.550
The point difference for Raimon increases by double!

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:27.970
Yukiji. Points scored x2.

00:05:30.870 --> 00:05:31.900
I don't believe it...

00:05:31.900 --> 00:05:33.060
Our promise...

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:39.690
Why can't he block it?

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:43.440
Sangoku-senpai should be able to...

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:55.400
He's slipped past Kurumada!

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:04.100
It's a pass miss! The ball got kicked too far!

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:11.120
Something <i>is</i>  wrong with Sangoku-senpai, Kurumada-senpai, Kirino-senpai, and Hamano-senpai...

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:12.920
This isn't Raimon's soccer.

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:14.770
It isn't <i>their</i>  soccer!

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:34.520
That play...

00:06:34.520 --> 00:06:35.540
Could it be...?

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:40.040
He finally figured it out.

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:41.710
Kindaichi!

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:44.220
The ball gets passed into the penalty area!

00:06:44.220 --> 00:06:46.670
But it goes too far!

00:06:48.830 --> 00:06:51.220
There goes the whistle for the first half!

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:55.720
It ends at a score of 2-0 with Eito Academy in the lead!

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:02.310
We're counting on you again for the second half.

00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:11.490
Everyone, we have your drinks ready, so get hydrated properly.

00:07:20.900 --> 00:07:23.270
Why are you playing like that?

00:07:26.370 --> 00:07:29.180
Sangoku-senpai and Kurumada-senpai,

00:07:29.180 --> 00:07:32.840
Amagi-senpai and Minamisawa-senpai and Kirino-senpai,

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:36.850
Kurama-senpai and Hayami-senpai and Hamano-senpai!

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:40.980
Captain! Why won't you fight them seriously?!

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:45.270
H-Hey, Tenma, what are you going on about?

00:07:45.910 --> 00:07:51.210
If you all played seriously, you can break down Eito's defense like a snap!

00:07:51.210 --> 00:07:53.130
So why?!

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:55.510
Why are you holding back?!

00:07:55.510 --> 00:07:58.170
Are you okay with losing?!

00:07:58.170 --> 00:08:00.040
It's okay to lose.

00:08:03.480 --> 00:08:06.100
We haven't told you yet,

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:12.420
but the score for this match has already been decided to be 3-0 as Raimon's loss.

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:15.340
Already been decided?

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:16.720
What do you mean?

00:08:21.470 --> 00:08:23.270
You know of Fifth Sector, right?

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:27.770
Yes, it's the place that manages Japan's soccer.

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:29.080
Yes.

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:30.980
But they don't just manage it.

00:08:31.770 --> 00:08:39.030
Fifth Sector also decides the scores for each game and notifies each school via a score order whether they win or lose.

00:08:39.380 --> 00:08:41.010
They decide the scores?

00:08:41.010 --> 00:08:42.330
Why would they do that?

00:08:43.010 --> 00:08:45.010
To protect order.

00:08:45.010 --> 00:08:46.190
Order?

00:08:47.010 --> 00:08:53.360
As you already know, a school's merit in these times is based on how strong their soccer is.

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:55.970
If it's weak, the school isn't even worth looking into.

00:08:55.970 --> 00:09:01.710
That's why Fifth Sector sends out score orders, so that merit can be fairly divided among schools.

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:03.310
Fairly?

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:08.890
As long as you obey their orders, you'll receive a winning game that'll allow you to adjust your school's reputation.

00:09:10.220 --> 00:09:11.260
That means...

00:09:11.260 --> 00:09:12.690
It means everything's fixed!

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:15.050
Yes.

00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:19.700
That's why only a portion of those connected to soccer know about this.

00:09:20.650 --> 00:09:22.950
This is the reality behind soccer nowadays.

00:09:25.490 --> 00:09:27.760
That's wrong.

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:30.670
Having scores set from the very beginning...

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:32.170
That's not soccer!

00:09:32.470 --> 00:09:33.960
What would you know?!

00:09:35.890 --> 00:09:41.140
What would you know about how we feel playing soccer?

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:44.550
About how Sangoku-san feels having to let those shoots go in?

00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:47.730
Do you know how that feels?!

00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:50.880
We want to play too!

00:09:50.880 --> 00:09:53.840
If we could, we'd go all out playing the soccer we love!

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:59.770
But if we oppose Fifth Sector, we'll get soccer taken from us!

00:09:59.770 --> 00:10:01.620
That's why we...!

00:10:05.170 --> 00:10:05.910
Shindou!

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:17.350
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:22.830
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:10:25.190 --> 00:10:28.960
I never knew soccer turned out this way...

00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:31.040
Tenma...

00:10:35.330 --> 00:10:37.390
<i>That's wrong.</i>

00:10:37.390 --> 00:10:39.910
<i>Having scores set from the very beginning...</i>

00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:41.990
<i>That's not soccer!</i>

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:53.160
Why did Coach let that guy join the soccer club?

00:10:59.020 --> 00:11:01.300
Hey, Tenma, it's starting.

00:11:06.130 --> 00:11:08.610
Both teams are in position!

00:11:08.610 --> 00:11:10.350
The second half will soon begin!

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:13.240
The point difference is 2-0 with Eito Academy's lead!

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:18.700
Will Raimon end up losing or catching up using their spirits of tenacity?!

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:21.430
Is he gonna be okay?

00:11:23.020 --> 00:11:26.620
The second half starts with Eito Academy's kickoff!

00:11:26.980 --> 00:11:28.350
In any case, I gotta cheer him on!

00:11:28.350 --> 00:11:29.650
Go, Tenma!

00:11:32.470 --> 00:11:33.370
Tenma!

00:11:33.820 --> 00:11:36.420
What is he just standing there for?

00:11:37.810 --> 00:11:40.110
Looks like he's learned his place.

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:44.300
This is soccer as it is now.

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:45.430
If you don't like it, just quit!

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:46.980
Tenma...

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:55.750
We'll keep the match even until I give the signal.

00:11:56.850 --> 00:11:57.730
Yomiya!

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:04.040
As Eito Academy attacks, Raimon defends!

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:07.490
A fierce clash breaks out only minutes into the second half!

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:10.570
Has Raimon gathered themselves back together during half-time?

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:13.840
An even game continues as they move as one mind!

00:12:15.190 --> 00:12:16.240
Tenma...

00:12:21.480 --> 00:12:22.130
Fukuro!

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:23.410
Here comes the other team's challenge!

00:12:23.410 --> 00:12:24.840
Will Matsukaze be able to stop him?

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:25.880
Tenma!

00:12:25.880 --> 00:12:27.680
Move! You're in my way!

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:31.180
Tenma!

00:12:32.360 --> 00:12:35.150
He's gotten past Matsukaze!

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:39.450
Coach, maybe we should send Tenma-kun outside the pitch...

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:41.910
No, we'll keep him there.

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:43.070
But Coach!

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:49.430
It's about time.

00:12:49.430 --> 00:12:51.170
Fukuro, pass to Yukiji!

00:12:55.710 --> 00:12:56.580
He's coming.

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:58.580
Perfect Course!

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:10.210
This is the last one.

00:13:15.630 --> 00:13:18.690
Burning Catch!

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:28.360
Goal!

00:13:28.360 --> 00:13:30.860
Eito Academy takes another point!

00:13:30.860 --> 00:13:33.830
The difference has increased by three!

00:13:36.760 --> 00:13:38.490
Sangoku-senpai...

00:13:38.490 --> 00:13:39.760
This is wrong.

00:13:42.740 --> 00:13:44.260
This is wrong!

00:13:45.270 --> 00:13:46.260
Tenma...

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:48.800
Nishizono, get back in place.

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:50.220
O-Okay!

00:13:54.340 --> 00:13:57.580
The score is 3-0! Will Raimon catch up?!

00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:02.650
The ball gets suddenly stolen from Raimon!

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:10.850
Their huge lead spurs on Eito Academy to keep pushing them back!

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:13.280
Will Raimon end up losing?!

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:15.360
This is wrong...

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:18.010
This isn't soccer!

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:21.840
It's making soccer cry!

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:36.500
Here, Matsukaze steals the ball!

00:14:36.940 --> 00:14:38.100
What are you doing?

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:38.100
{o}Captain!

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:40.400
And he passes to Shindou!

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:42.760
But it goes too far!

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:46.320
What's he doing?

00:14:46.870 --> 00:14:47.980
I'll get it this time!

00:14:48.980 --> 00:14:51.780
Matsukaze goes to steal the ball again!

00:14:52.180 --> 00:14:53.770
Is he...?

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:58.260
It seems you have a dropout player who doesn't know how to go by the book.

00:14:58.260 --> 00:15:00.710
You think someone like you can steal from me?

00:15:02.720 --> 00:15:03.750
Yukiji!

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:07.710
He uses his own body to block it!

00:15:07.960 --> 00:15:08.590
Captain!

00:15:09.940 --> 00:15:11.900
This time his pass falls short!

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:13.300
I won't give up!

00:15:14.070 --> 00:15:14.640
Stop!

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:17.670
This match has a score order!

00:15:17.670 --> 00:15:19.330
We're supposed to lose!

00:15:19.860 --> 00:15:21.330
I won't accept it.

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:24.280
For us to lose like this... I'll never accept it!

00:15:33.690 --> 00:15:34.990
What incredible spirit!

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:37.550
He uses his entire body to steal back the ball!

00:15:37.550 --> 00:15:40.500
And Matsukaze continues passing the ball to Shindou!

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:41.890
Captain!

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:44.380
Captain!

00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:46.880
Captain!

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:50.300
Stop this, Matsukaze!

00:15:50.730 --> 00:15:51.570
Captain!

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:52.750
Captain!

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:54.010
Captain!

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:55.300
Captain!

00:15:55.770 --> 00:15:56.510
Captain!

00:15:57.160 --> 00:15:58.390
It's no use.

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:00.390
That guy...

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:02.270
Tenma...

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:07.270
Captain!

00:16:13.430 --> 00:16:15.750
Don't get so cocky!

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:17.410
Kindaichi!

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:24.080
Shinsuke!

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:24.740
Tenma!

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:36.170
Captain!

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:58.030
Moonsault Stamp!

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:05.850
Goal!

00:17:05.850 --> 00:17:08.880
Raimon finally wrestles one point from Eito Academy!

00:17:09.140 --> 00:17:10.590
All right!

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:15.360
But the game is over!

00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:17.150
Raimon's counterattack has to end here!

00:17:17.150 --> 00:17:21.040
At a score of 3-1, it's Eito Academy's victory!

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:25.440
I thought they weren't supposed to score at all!

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:30.220
This is bad...

00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:35.280
Shindou!

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:37.170
Why did you shoot?

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:38.730
He...

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:42.510
His ball was urging me to do it.

00:17:42.510 --> 00:17:43.580
Urging you?

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:48.350
His ball was telling me to face soccer straight-on.

00:17:49.690 --> 00:17:53.310
Is that why you made the shoot?

00:17:56.040 --> 00:17:57.130
We did it...

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:58.370
We did it!

00:17:58.370 --> 00:17:59.470
Tenma!

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:01.740
You did it!

00:18:01.740 --> 00:18:03.680
You're the best!

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:06.990
I knew I had an eye for these things!

00:18:10.260 --> 00:18:12.070
You guys are laughing too much!

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:13.330
I'm older than you, you know!

00:18:13.330 --> 00:18:13.970
But...!

00:18:13.970 --> 00:18:15.500
But whatever!

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:19.230
Matsukaze Tenma...

00:18:24.740 --> 00:18:27.290
3... 3-1?!

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:29.330
Whatever do you mean?!

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:31.660
The score order said 3-0!

00:18:31.660 --> 00:18:34.080
This is going against regulations!

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:38.050
I-I have no idea myself how it happened...

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:39.960
Bring Kudou-kun here at once!

00:18:39.960 --> 00:18:41.310
Y-Yes, sir!

00:18:42.860 --> 00:18:48.000
How am I going to explain this to Fifth Sector?

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:50.300
But wait...

00:18:50.300 --> 00:18:54.080
This could be the perfect opportunity to run Kudou out of here.

00:18:56.720 --> 00:18:58.750
Are you okay, Tenma?

00:18:58.750 --> 00:19:00.580
Yeah, of course!

00:19:00.580 --> 00:19:02.530
But I'm worried about what'll happen from now on.

00:19:03.150 --> 00:19:05.880
Who knows what Fifth Sector will say...

00:19:12.390 --> 00:19:13.500
It'll work out somehow.

00:19:14.620 --> 00:19:16.050
Work out somehow?

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:30.940
You're right!

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:32.480
It'll work out somehow!

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:34.650
Yeah, somehow!

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:39.360
It'll work out!

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:41.960
Hey, let's start practicing again tomorrow!

00:19:41.960 --> 00:19:42.820
Yeah!

00:19:43.720 --> 00:19:44.800
Wait for me!

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:55.130
Why did I make that shoot?

00:20:00.810 --> 00:20:02.010
Sangoku-san?

00:20:02.480 --> 00:20:04.010
Yes, this is Shindou.

00:20:06.840 --> 00:20:07.930
Coach Kudou?

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:14.520
He was forced to take on responsibility for ignoring the score order!

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:19.030
But why does that mean Coach Kudou has to quit?

00:20:20.450 --> 00:20:21.600
Coach!

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:27.170
I'm sorry!

00:20:27.170 --> 00:20:30.070
It's because I made that shoot...!

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:33.280
You're wrong.

00:20:33.280 --> 00:20:35.380
It's because my role is over.

00:20:36.440 --> 00:20:38.060
Besides, Shindou...

00:20:38.060 --> 00:20:41.210
When you made that shoot, you must have felt something.

00:20:42.900 --> 00:20:43.930
Something?

00:20:45.530 --> 00:20:47.030
<i>Captain!</i>

00:20:54.080 --> 00:20:56.060
Don't forget that feeling.

00:20:58.810 --> 00:20:59.720
Coach...

00:21:08.520 --> 00:21:09.210
It's here!

00:21:10.190 --> 00:21:11.930
Yes, this is Megane.

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:14.540
It's Kudou. Begin the operation as we planned.

00:21:14.930 --> 00:21:16.330
I've been waiting for this!

00:21:18.220 --> 00:21:19.940
Now, let's get started...

00:21:21.270 --> 00:21:26.250
The real fun is just beginning.

00:22:54.120 --> 00:22:56.010
Coach Kudou resigned?

00:22:56.010 --> 00:22:59.630
Another new wind blows through Raimon!

